{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 Wishlist now to follow development and get notified at launch!<br>\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Join our Discord and be a part of the playtest!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/2345d39a6864c20bd3776886e0d87a81.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Roy \u2014 a rogue AI without a body. Your only way to survive is to <strong>steal enemy robots</strong> and turn them against their makers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project Roy</i> is a fast-paced FPS roguelike where every enemy is a weapon, every death is a chance to adapt, and every run brings you one step closer to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/bf799fea671eec8f63438c63c22a7224.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/cedf66ddb4ac80fec9680475ba74046c.poster.avif?t=1757312099\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/cedf66ddb4ac80fec9680475ba74046c.webm?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/cedf66ddb4ac80fec9680475ba74046c.mp4?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roy can<strong> hijack enemy robots</strong> in the middle of battle. Run low on health? Jump to another body. Outnumbered? Steal a stronger frame. Every fight becomes a puzzle of survival and opportunity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/a666cf9c8c8650bb831703fdb4c66a8b.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/d5a2a7410f7be8be894351ca711df77e.poster.avif?t=1757312099\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/d5a2a7410f7be8be894351ca711df77e.webm?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/d5a2a7410f7be8be894351ca711df77e.mp4?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Sullivan Corporation knows you\u2019ve escaped. Their response? <strong>Unleashing waves of deadly machines</strong> to stop you. Fast reflexes and smart thinking are your only hope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based combat that gets harder with each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face robots with unique AI, weapons, and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic FPS chaos \u2014 shoot, strafe, slide, and dominate</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/2c1d6bea014001d54fb9a304334bc90a.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/47ff472e374041c1f5872a844a825630.poster.avif?t=1757312099\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/47ff472e374041c1f5872a844a825630.webm?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/47ff472e374041c1f5872a844a825630.mp4?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each robot you hijack completely changes how you fight \u2014 from agile run-and-gun Rangers to slow, brutal Tanks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ranger</strong> \u2013 Assault rifle, deployable shield, and grenade launcher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank</strong> \u2013 Minigun, gravitational pull, and a bullet-reflecting matrix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trickster, Breacher, and more</strong> \u2013 Each with signature abilities, weapons, and playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/0f955b7442e18695cb6912c87b971cf7.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/598ce625540cb015a0d5ef2e70efb250.poster.avif?t=1757312099\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/598ce625540cb015a0d5ef2e70efb250.webm?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/598ce625540cb015a0d5ef2e70efb250.mp4?t=1757312099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every possession, every kill \u2014 makes you stronger. Customize each run with randomized upgrade cards, and evolve Roy\u2019s AI between battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Temporary Upgrades \u2013 Power-up on the fly with combat abilities and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Roy Level Progression \u2013 Earn XP across runs to level up and push deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize Your Build \u2013 Stack upgrades to suit your playstyle: brute force, control, or speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/f563294fe9efe09dc9d008d6c88a9b3c.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sullivan Facility is a living labyrinth of high-tech experimentation and ruthless control. Can you make it out?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labs</strong> \u2013 Clinical, neon-lit testing chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Sectors</strong> \u2013 Steam-filled arenas and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate HQ</strong> \u2013 The final gauntlet\u2026 and your ultimate adversary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/9bc2c421bf0eacf5a1b9f912b9b89118.avif?t=1757312099\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape the system that created you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist <i>Project Roy</i> to be the first to play this unique FPS roguelike.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480960?t=1757312099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757312099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/34